<title>PANAMA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>PANAMA GOVERNMENT LIST (961009)</p>
<p>   President....................Ernesto PEREZ BALLADARES (PRD)</p>
<p>	 (Took office 1 Sept 94)</p>
<p>First Vice-President...Tomas Gabriel ALTAMIRANO Duque (PRD)</p>
<p>   Second Vice-President....................Felipe VIRZI (PRD)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION GOVERNMENT (Took office 1 Sept 94)</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>   Agricultural Development..........Carlos Sousa LENNOX (XPA)</p>
<p>   Commerce &amp; Industries.....................Raul ARANGO (LIB)</p>
<p>   Education...........................Pablo THALASSINOS (IND)</p>
<p>   Finance, Treasury........................Miguel HERAS (PRD)</p>
<p>   Foreign Relations.......................Ricardo ARIAS (IND)</p>
<p>   Government &amp; Justice..................Raul MONTENEGRO (PRD)</p>
<p>   Health...........................Aida Libia de RIVERA (PRD)</p>
<p>   Housing.............................Francisco SANCHEZ (PRD)</p>
<p>   Labour &amp; Social Welfare.................Mitchel DOENS (PRD)</p>
