<p>XPD - Former member of the Christian Democratic Party</p>
<p>				   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>   Attorney General.........................Jose Antonio SOSSA</p>
<p>				   - - - - -</p>
<p>   Central Bank Director.......................Jose DE LA OSSA</p>
<p>(National Bank of Panama)</p>
<p>				     - - - - - - -</p>
